      "writtenOn": "2024-10-13T22:43:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Great, thanks everyone for the feedback.\n\n@ynaffit@google.com It looks like this is a viable option. Would you like to give it a try? For the testing, presubmit will help. You may also check the log messages from libselinux at boot time. Thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "f36ebfb1_6a8c95f0",
      "revId": "9f16e0318502adfc15afe68a0216a6b3090fd00f",
